## Backend base URL (no trailing slash). Example:
## - Local backend:   http://localhost:3000
## - Render backend:  https://attendance-backend-hv7t.onrender.com
##
## Vite reads `.env` / `.env.local` (not `.env.example`), so copy this file to `.env`
## and restart `npm run dev` after changing it.
VITE_API_URL=http://localhost:3000

